  "reason": "The best result so far is config_039 (scVI n200 + ViT-L + transformer + weighted, acc=0.7250). The evidence strongly supports scVI n200 over scGPT/PCA, ViT-L over ResNet50, multi-profile over single, and weighted over concat (0.7131 vs 0.6878 with ResNet50). However, the weighted-vs-concat comparison was only tested with ResNet50; ViT-L produces fundamentally different feature geometry (patch-based, higher-dimensional), so the optimal fusion strategy may shift. config_038 isolates this single variable (concat vs weighted) while keeping all other components at their best-evidenced settings. As the final experiment, it either reveals a new best configuration or confirms that weighted fusion is robust across image encoders, solidifying config_039 as the definitive winner."
